            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A dressing (44) has a base (45) which is to be adhered to a patient about a catheter site, an opening (24) in the base (45) to pull a catheter line (55) through and two covers (48, 49) with windows (27, 27') for folding over separate sections (46, 47) of a base (45) to seal in the components of a catheter assembly (52) with multiple catheters (53) extending from a common housing (54).</p>
